#. module: conversation_imap
#: model:ir.model,name:conversation_imap.model_conversation_transport
msgid "Conversation Transport"
msgstr "Boîte courriel de conversation"

#. module: conversation_imap
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:conversation_imap.field_conversation_transport__smtp_ssl
msgid ""
"Deprecated alias of the SMTP Encryption field, kept for callers that still "
"read or write the old checkbox: true means STARTTLS, false means no "
"encryption."
msgstr ""
"Ancien alias du champ Chiffrement SMTP, conservé pour les appelants qui "
"lisent ou écrivent encore l'ancienne case : vrai signifie STARTTLS, faux "
"signifie aucun chiffrement."

#. module: conversation_imap
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:conversation_imap.field_conversation_transport__display_name
msgid "Display Name"
msgstr "Nom affiché"

#. module: conversation_imap
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:conversation_imap.field_conversation_transport__smtp_encryption
msgid ""
"How the SMTP connection is secured. STARTTLS is what servers usually expect "
"on port 587; SSL/TLS (implicit TLS, SMTPS) is what they usually expect on "
"port 465. Choose None only for a plain legacy relay."
msgstr ""
"Comment la connexion SMTP est sécurisée. STARTTLS est ce qu'attendent "
"habituellement les serveurs sur le port 587; SSL/TLS (TLS implicite, SMTPS) "
"est ce qu'ils attendent habituellement sur le port 465. Choisissez Aucun "
"seulement pour un relais simple et ancien."

